(2, 'Luxury Apartment', 'luxury-apartment-downtown-dubai', 'DRL-DT-202', 'Positioned in the vibrant epicenter of Downtown Dubai, this immaculate 2-bedroom luxury residence redefines cosmopolitan living. Offering uninterrupted panoramic views toward the Dubai Fountain and Burj Khalifa Boulevard, the property features a designer European kitchen with built-in Miele appliances, hardwood parquet flooring, and two lavish marble en-suite bathrooms.\n\nResidents enjoy direct indoor climate-controlled footbridge access to Dubai Mall, an Olympic-length skyline pool deck, state-of-the-art gym, valet parking, and 24/7 dedicated concierge services.', 2200000.00, 'AED', '', 2, 2, 1420.00, 'sale', 2, 2, 2, 'Burj Crown Tower, Downtown Dubai', 'published', 1, '/assets/images/apartment-downtown.jpg', 'DLD-810934-2025', '2023', 'furnished', 'Luxury Apartment in Downtown Dubai | AED 2,200,000 | DRL Dwarika', 'Prime 2 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom Luxury Apartment in Downtown Dubai for AED 2,200,000. Walking distance to Burj Khalifa & Dubai Mall with DRL Dwarika Real Estate.'),

-- 3. Spacious Townhouse (JVC, Agent: Sarah Al-Mansoori)
(3, 'Spacious Townhouse', 'spacious-townhouse-jvc', 'DRL-JVC-303', 'A sanctuary for modern family living, this pristine 3-bedroom plus maid townhouse in Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) combines space, privacy, and superior connectivity. Spread across two sunlit levels, the property features high ceilings, a generous private landscaped rear garden, and a rooftop leisure terrace perfect for evening entertainment.\n\nIncludes three spacious master suites with built-in wardrobes, fitted quartz kitchen, covered dual car parking, and immediate access to central community parks and Circle Mall.', 3100000.00, 'AED', '', 3, 3, 2680.00, 'sale', 3, 3, 3, 'District 12, Jumeirah Village Circle, Dubai', 'published', 1, '/assets/images/townhouse-jvc.jpg', 'DLD-528391-2025', '2024', 'unfurnished', 'Spacious Townhouse in JVC Dubai | AED 3,100,000 | DRL Dwarika', 'Explore this 3 Bed, 3 Bath Spacious Townhouse in Jumeirah Village Circle for AED 3,100,000. Family friendly community with private garden with DRL Dwarika Real Estate.'),

